        <div class="definition-box">
          Every Bitsy tile is 8×8 pixels — the grid never changes. But an element can claim one tile or many. A door that spans two tiles reads as something you walk through. A door that's the same size as the player reads as a wall mark. Scale is a compositional decision, not a drawing one. The player is the fixed reference point. Everything else is large or small relative to it.
        </div>

